msgstr ""

#: processes/bean-lifecycle.bpmn:65
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "STRICT. `beans create` is not idempotent: it mints a fresh id every call and dedupes on nothing, so re-entering a step duplicates the plan instead of no-op'ing. In the qou folio an unguarded re-run produced 14,688 duplicate beans — 92% of every open bean — which starved the idle-backlog policy of signal and collided with 15 real ids."
msgstr ""

#: processes/bean-lifecycle.bpmn:56
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The only task in this diagram with no `folio:bean` op at all — every other terminal action here writes something, and this one's entire job is to write nothing to a bean it does not own, ending the lifecycle at End_NotYours rather than at the completion Lane_Agent reaches for its own beans."
msgstr ""

